# ===== Suitest (jangan commit) =====
# Runtime data lokal Suitest (database, virtualenv, kredensial, artifacts, log)
.suitest/

# Output hasil generate/run Suitest (discovery, reports, evidence)
suitest-output/

# Log & screenshot runtime provider Playwright MCP (berisi tangkapan halaman)
